            "preheading": "",
            "preheading_color": "#4d4d4d",
            "heading": "Creating Homes, Building Relationships",
            "heading_color": "#4d4d4d",
            "heading_size": "large",
            "text_content": "<p>Thank you for choosing <strong>PremiumBackyard.ca</strong>, where we're dedicated to enhancing your Home and Business experiences. At PremiumBackyard.ca, we understand the unique needs of Canadian Home and Business owners. We value the importance of creating a comfortable and enjoyable Home or Business space for their families, friends and/or customers.</p><p>Founded in the Spring of 2023 by\u00a0<strong>Dan Schafer</strong>, an avid, Alberta-based e-commerce entrepreneur, who shares your passion for unique, quality products that contribute to your Home or Business. Recognizing the diverse lifestyles of our customers, we aim to provide not just products but modern solutions that align with your aspirations.</p>",
            "text_content_color": "#4d4d4d",
            "button_link": "shopify://pages/about-us",
            "button_text": "Learn Our Story",
            "button_style": "primary_with_icon",
            "feature_text_1": "",
